  "solution": "**Logic**: [(First no.) : {(First no × 2) + 1} : (First no.)³]\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n1. 2 ∶ 5 ∶ 8 → [(2) : {(2 × 2) + 1} : (2)3] → [(2) : (5) : (2)3]\n\n2. 5 ∶ 10 ∶ 125 → [(5) : (5 **×** 2) : (5)3] → [(5) : (10) : (5)3]\n\n3. 12 ∶ 25 ∶ 1728 → [(12) : {(12 × 2) + 1} : (12)3] → [(12) : (25) : (12)3]\n\n4. 3 ∶ 7 ∶ 27 → [(3) : {(3 × 2) + 1} : (3)3] → [(3) : (7) : (3)3]\n\nHere, in (5 : 10 : 125) different logic is followed.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".\n\n60:Tbb8,\n<p",
